WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.162
Price before the product is perfect.

00:00:02.162 --> 00:00:05.044
A test price teaches faster than free forever.

00:00:05.044 --> 00:00:07.927
This lesson is about pricing that feels fair.

00:00:07.927 --> 00:00:09.368
Price before perfect product.

00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:11.890
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:15.493
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:15.493 --> 00:00:20.897
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:20.897 --> 00:00:24.860
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:29.184
Stay practical: set a test price before you optimize branding or tools.

00:00:29.504 --> 00:00:32.587
Choose a test price you can say out loud.

00:00:32.587 --> 00:00:34.986
Raise it later when evidence supports it.

00:00:34.986 --> 00:00:37.384
Remember the objective: set a test price.

00:00:37.384 --> 00:00:41.153
